OL,3,GNEWSACharles Bronson denied parole for
OL,4,Aninth time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel was not satisfied that his
OL,7,Frelease from HMP Wakefield would be
OL,8,F"safe for the protection of the
OL,9,Fpublic", citing his "limited progress"
OL,10,Fin custody and the other evidence
OL,11,Fbefore it.
